{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>A New Experience in Sci-Fi Action Roguelike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021240/extras/aad17bfc43a8b37abe65dee6773d0766.poster.avif?t=1758452117\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021240/extras/aad17bfc43a8b37abe65dee6773d0766.webm?t=1758452117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Retroid: Cartridge Protocol</i> combines <strong>fast-paced combat, unpredictable enemies, and the thrill of progression</strong> into a high-quality sci-fi roguelike experience. Every run offers new battles and strategic choices, keeping the challenge fresh and immersive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 This is our first demo!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey of <strong>Zero-One</strong>, the last hope against the Overmind army, begins now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As this is the <strong>first public version</strong>, there are still many rough edges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That\u2019s why your feedback is incredibly valuable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your honest thoughts from battle, and help us prepare for stronger evolutions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f What\u2019s next</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We plan to launch <strong>Early Access later this year</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo is only the beginning of that journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your feedback and support, we\u2019ll expand the content and polish the gameplay\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ultimately leading to the mission of <strong>finding every cartridge, unlocking your final evolution, and reclaiming the planet from the Overmind army</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcd8 <strong>Lore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021240/extras/7ba28e9116476c3207c9a5097216ee58.poster.avif?t=1758452117\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021240/extras/7ba28e9116476c3207c9a5097216ee58.webm?t=1758452117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once overshadowed, Dr. Victor stole Dr. Evelyn\u2019s groundbreaking technology out of envy, creating the Overmind army to seize control of the planet. As Prototype Zero-One, you are the only one who can unlock the hidden power within the cartridges and reclaim the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable battles</strong> \u2013 Enemy evolutions create new combat patterns every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple yet deep controls</strong> \u2013 Outsmart foes and map traps with melee strikes and precise dashes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress through exploration</strong> \u2013 Permanent and temporary upgrades fuel long-term growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed sci-fi design</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in a richly crafted futuristic world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021240/extras/580a29052fc7398c1d0052aa2fe08823.poster.avif?t=1758452117\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021240/extras/580a29052fc7398c1d0052aa2fe08823.webm?t=1758452117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find every cartridge. Unlock your final evolution.</strong> <br><strong>Take back the planet from the Overmind army.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4021240?t=1758452117","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021240/eabd5e9272500856f170439d4b3c9ad5bea6afff/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758452117","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021240/e03de520c96bf7adf32eb66360f6d12d50fd813b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758452117","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021240/e03de520c96bf7adf32eb66360f6d12d50fd813b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758452117","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>A New Experience in Sci-Fi Action Roguelike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021240/extras/aad17bfc43a8b37abe65dee6773d0766.poster.avif?t=1758452117\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021240/extras/aad17bfc43a8b37abe65dee6773d0766.webm?t=1758452117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Retroid: Cartridge Protocol</i> combines <strong>fast-paced combat, unpredictable enemies, and the thrill of progression</strong> into a high-quality sci-fi roguelike experience. Every run offers new battles and strategic choices, keeping the challenge fresh and immersive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 This is our first demo!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey of <strong>Zero-One</strong>, the last hope against the Overmind army, begins now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As this is the <strong>first public version</strong>, there are still many rough edges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That\u2019s why your feedback is incredibly valuable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your honest thoughts from battle, and help us prepare for stronger evolutions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f What\u2019s next</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We plan to launch <strong>Early Access later this year</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo is only the beginning of that journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your feedback and support, we\u2019ll expand the content and polish the gameplay\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ultimately leading to the mission of <strong>finding every cartridge, unlocking your final evolution, and reclaiming the planet from the Overmind army</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcd8 <strong>Lore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021240/extras/7ba28e9116476c3207c9a5097216ee58.poster.avif?t=1758452117\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021240/extras/7ba28e9116476c3207c9a5097216ee58.webm?t=1758452117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once overshadowed, Dr. Victor stole Dr. Evelyn\u2019s groundbreaking technology out of envy, creating the Overmind army to seize control of the planet. As Prototype Zero-One, you are the only one who can unlock the hidden power within the cartridges and reclaim the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable battles</strong> \u2013 Enemy evolutions create new combat patterns every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple yet deep controls</strong> \u2013 Outsmart foes and map traps with melee strikes and precise dashes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress through exploration</strong> \u2013 Permanent and temporary upgrades fuel long-term growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed sci-fi design</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in a richly crafted futuristic world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021240/extras/580a29052fc7398c1d0052aa2fe08823.poster.avif?t=1758452117\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021240/extras/580a29052fc7398c1d0052aa2fe08823.webm?t=1758452117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find every cartridge. Unlock your final evolution.</strong> <br><strong>Take back the planet from the Overmind army.</strong></p>","developers":["Zero1Play"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3867650","name":"Retroid: Cartridge Protocol"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021240/ea8095c3e4ea2559bc0a79258ba79c45fc6d7e9a/header.jpg?t=1758452117","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul